flowchart TB
  accTitle: Custom clock targets, automatic overclocking and bounded backoff
  accDescr: Lower custom targets use no second voltage sweep. Upward searches use finite rungs and higher-voltage retries within the endpoint.
  INPUT([Passing undervolt result]) --> CUSTOM{"Explicit custom target<br/>differs from Auto defaults?"}
  CUSTOM -->|Lower MHz| DOWN["Test lower clocks at the proven voltage<br/>At most 10 steps; stop on ordinary failure or cache<br/>Do not repeat voltage descent"]
  CUSTOM -->|Same MHz / voltage cap prevents a climb| ELIGIBLE
  DOWN --> ELIGIBLE{"Any passing measured candidate<br/>inside the custom limits?"}
  ELIGIBLE -->|Yes| CUSTOMDONE([Select a passing custom curve])
  ELIGIBLE -->|No| ERROR["Report unmet custom target<br/>Earlier checkpoints remain available"]
  CUSTOM -->|Higher MHz, voltage permits| LADDER
  CUSTOM -->|Auto| POLICY["Performance: OC toward the endpoint<br/>Full-scan E/B: reclaim clock when power-bound<br/>No table endpoint: retain the passing undervolt"]
  POLICY -->|Clock work needed| LADDER["Build at most 10 unique main rungs<br/>Use editable voltage bins and the MHz ceiling"]
  POLICY -->|Not needed / no endpoint| AUTODONE([Keep the passing undervolt])
  LADDER --> NEXT{"Legal rung remains<br/>outside failed / consumed bands?"}
  NEXT -->|No| KEEP["Keep the passing selection<br/>Custom search: apply limits and tier scoring<br/>No eligible custom point → target error"]
  NEXT -->|Yes| BLOCK{"Cached unsafe point?"}
  BLOCK -->|Yes| BACKOFF["At most one bounded fallback attempt<br/>Selected passing MHz at highest legal ladder voltage<br/>Then end the climb"]
  BACKOFF -->|Ordinary result| KEEP
  BACKOFF -->|Critical| ABORT
  BLOCK -->|No| PROBE["Probe the complete candidate"]
  PROBE --> OUTCOME{"Outcome"}
  OUTCOME -->|Critical| ABORT([Abort the whole run])
  OUTCOME -->|Pass| POWER{"Confirmed power wall?"}
  POWER -->|Yes: retain earlier passing selection| KEEP
  POWER -->|No: update best passing selection| NEXT
  OUTCOME -->|Ordinary failure| RETRY["Retry the same MHz at higher editable voltages<br/>Never above the voltage ceiling<br/>Skip failed and consumed voltage bands"]
  RETRY -->|Continue finite remaining rungs| NEXT
  RETRY -->|Critical| ABORT
  classDef work fill:#19334b,stroke:#84c7f5,color:#edf5fa,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef gate fill:#302c20,stroke:#e9bd76,color:#fff0d8,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef stop fill:#40252a,stroke:#ef9595,color:#fff0f0,stroke-width:1.5px
  class INPUT,DOWN,POLICY,LADDER,PROBE,KEEP,CUSTOMDONE,AUTODONE work
  class CUSTOM,ELIGIBLE,NEXT,BLOCK,BACKOFF,OUTCOME,POWER,RETRY,ERROR gate
  class ABORT stop
